If have uploaded a new version of PatchHack to my homepage. Because I
have lost track about the current version count, this is officially
version n+1, test version 1. 


Included patches:

death_explore (Enter explore mode after death)
paranoia      (Various options for security seeking players)
dump          (Write character dump after death)
hpmon         (Coloured hp-display (TTY only))
logmoves      (Write number of moves into logfile)
helpless      (More detailed reason for death by helplessness)
menucolor     (Color menu items by pattern matching (TTY only))
titles        (New role titles for Samurai and rejected heros)
T genocide    (PLONK)
extborn       (Show number of monsters born)


Binary at
	http://www.online-club.de/~phlucas/PH_np1_test1.zip .
Windows only, console and window version. Sample configuration file to
turn on some of the patches included.


I have collected a few other patches that I would like to include, but
many would change the gameplay quite a bit. Direct any bug reports to me,
as well as any suggestions for further patches. 

Examples of interesting patches of various depth include:

New big rooms
Grudge
instant-cat
invisible objects
Heck
Make photos with cameras
changed behaviour of bag of tricks
colour alchemy

